# tsc -b output for vite.config.ts (tsconfig.node.json) - if this ever
# reappears next to vite.config.ts, Vite silently prefers it over the .ts
# source and every config change goes ignored. See tsconfig.node.json's
# outDir for the actual fix; this is a backstop.
